<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<project name="Designer Candidate App 01" themePath="default" format="1.8" designerBuild="180">
<forms>
<form name="Form 1" startPoint="true" themePath="default" process="Process 1">
<items>
<text label="T1" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>This form is used in two ways:</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>1. It will collect information from your users.</font><sp/><font>Each time a user submits this form an email is sent to you via a conneted process.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Note that in this demo we display a Document, rather than sending an email.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>2. This form also appears when you choose to </font><font><b><i>Edit</i></b></font><font> a user record via the </font><font><b><i>Administration Form</i></b></font><font>.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Note that in this case you do not want to generate an email, and you want to return to the </font><font><b><i>Administration Form</i></b></font><font> when you submit this form.</font></paragraph></text>
<heading label="H1" type="Main"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="360" color="000000">User Information Form</font></paragraph></heading>
<fib label="Q1" style="topLabels"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">What is your name? </font><blank label="a" length="20" required="true"/></paragraph></fib>
<mc label="Q2" onlyone="true" required="true"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">What is your favorite fruit?</font></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Apple</font></paragraph></choice><choice label="b"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Banana</font></paragraph></choice><choice label="c"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Orange</font></paragraph></choice><choice label="d"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Pear</font></paragraph></choice><choice label="e"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Strawberries</font></paragraph></choice><choice label="f"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Other</font></paragraph></choice></mc>
</items>
</form>
<form name="Form 2" startPoint="true" themePath="default" process="Process 2">
<items>
<text label="T1" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>You get to this form either via the "Invitation" link in the email generated by the User Information Form, or directly from your Tawala project or the link in your </font><font><b><i>My Tawala </i></b></font><font>area of the Web site.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>It uses a "Function" to display the table below.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>The connected process handles your choice of action.  If you enter an invalid name for </font><font><b><i>Edit</i></b></font><font> or </font><font><b><i>Delete</i></b></font><font>, an error message will be displayed.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Note that </font><font><b><i>Editing</i></b></font><font> a record uses the original </font><font><b><i>User Information Form</i></b></font><font>, but submitting that form should not generate an email; rather it should return you to this form.</font></paragraph></text>
<heading label="H1" type="Main"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="360" color="000000">Administration Form</font></paragraph></heading>
<text label="T2"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Here are the respondents to the User Information Form:</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><itemization-table version="1"><number-of-columns>2</number-of-columns><column><header>Name</header><contents><field name="Record:Form 1:Q1:a" /></contents></column><column><header>Favorite Fruit</header><contents><field name="Record:Form 1:Q2" /></contents></column><conditions><form name="Form 1" /></conditions></itemization-table></font></paragraph></text>
<fib label="Q1" style="topLabels"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">To </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Delete</b></font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"> or </font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Edit</b></font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"> a record, enter the user's name: </font><blank label="a" length="20" required="false"/></paragraph></fib>
<mc label="Q2" onlyone="true" required="true"><question><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000">Choose an action</font></paragraph></question><choice label="a"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Delete</b></font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"> record</font></paragraph></choice><choice label="b"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Edit</b></font><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"> record</font></paragraph></choice><choice label="c"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="200" color="000000"><b>Exit</b></font></paragraph></choice></mc>
</items>
</form>
<form name="Form 3" startPoint="true" themePath="default" process="Process 3">
<items>
<heading label="H1" type="Main"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font face="Arial" size="360" color="000000">Introduction</font></paragraph></heading>
<text label="T1" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>This is a sample project that you can build with the </font><font><b><i>Tawala Designer</i></b></font><font> application. After reading this Introduction, you will actually be using a demo version of the project that you are asked to build.</font></paragraph></text>
<text label="T2" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Here are the major elements of the project:</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>1. There is a </font><font><b><i>User Information Form</i></b></font><font> that collects information from your users (their name and their favorite fruit).</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>2. Every time a user submits that form, an </font><font><b><i>email</i></b></font><font> is sent to you informing you of that fact.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>3. The email message contains an </font><font><b><i>"Invitation" link</i></b></font><sp/><font>that you can click on to take you to the </font><font><b><i>Administration Form</i></b></font><font>.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>4. The </font><font><b><i>Administration Form</i></b></font><font> allows you to see all your users' entries, and you may either </font><font><b><i>Delete</i></b></font><font> records, </font><font><b><i>Edit</i></b></font><font> records, or </font><font><b><i>Exit</i></b></font><font> the application.</font></paragraph></text>
<text label="T3" style="instructional"><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>There are a few differences between this version and the one you will be building. For example the one you build should send an actual email to yourself at the end of the </font><font><b><i>User Information Form</i></b></font><font>, rather than simply displaying a page as we do in this demo. You also do not need to include all the instructional text that we use to explain parts of the project to you as you proceed (such as this page).</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>At the same time, you should feel free to check out the many features available to you in the </font><font><b><i>Tawala Designer</i></b></font><font> application, and add to or embelish your project in any way you desire.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>Press the Submit button below to proceed. Good luck, and have fun!</font></paragraph></text>
</items>
</form>
</forms>
<processes>
<process name="Process 1">
<if>
<conditions>
<equals field="EditingRecord">
<string value="true"/>
</equals>
</conditions>
<trueSet>
<set field="EditingRecord" arithmeticAsText="false">
<string value="false"/>
</set>
<show form="Form 2"/>
</trueSet>
<falseSet>
<show document="Document 1" reset="false"/>
</falseSet>
</if>
</process>
<process name="Process 2">
<if>
<conditions>
<mcEquals field="Form 2:Q2" value="c"/>
</conditions>
<trueSet>
<show document="Document 2" reset="false"/>
</trueSet>
<falseSet>
<set field="count" arithmeticAsText="false">
<string value="0"/>
</set>
<get recordList="Record List 1">
<forms>
<form name="Form 1"/>
</forms>
<conditions>
<equals field="Record List 1:Form 1:Q1:a">
<string field="Form 2:Q1:a"/>
</equals>
</conditions></get>
<foreach record="Record" recordList="Record List 1">
<set field="count" arithmeticAsText="false">
<add>
<operand field="count"/>
<operand value="1"/>
</add>
</set>
</foreach>
<if>
<conditions>
<equals field="count">
<string value="0"/>
</equals>
</conditions>
<trueSet>
<show document="Document 3" reset="false"/>
</trueSet>
<falseSet>
<if>
<conditions>
<mcEquals field="Form 2:Q2" value="a"/>
</conditions>
<trueSet>
<delete><form name="Form 1"/><conditions>
<equals field="Record:Form 1:Q1:a">
<string field="Form 2:Q1:a"/>
</equals>
</conditions></delete>
</trueSet>
</if>
<if>
<conditions>
<mcEquals field="Form 2:Q2" value="b"/>
</conditions>
<trueSet>
<set field="EditingRecord" arithmeticAsText="false">
<string value="true"/>
</set>
<edit form="Form 1" submit="modify">
<conditions>
<equals field="Record:Form 1:Q1:a">
<string field="Form 2:Q1:a"/>
</equals>
</conditions>
</edit>
</trueSet>
</if>
</falseSet>
</if>
<show form="Form 2"/>
</falseSet>
</if>
</process>
<process name="Process 3">
<show form="Form 1"/>
</process>
</processes>
<documents>
<document name="Document 1">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>When implemented by you, submitting the previous Form should generate an email to you with the following message:</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><field name="Form 1:Q1:a"/></font><font> has responded to the User Information Form.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="000080"><u><invitation form="Form 2" project="">Click here</invitation></u></font><font> to go to the Administration Form.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph>
</xmlData>
</document>
<document name="Document 2">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>This Document appears if you selected </font><font><b>Exit</b></font><sp/><font>in the Administration Form.</font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font>All done! Thank you!</font></paragraph>
</xmlData>
</document>
<document name="Document 3">
<xmlData>
<paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font color="FF0000"><b>Error: The name </b></font><font color="FF0000"><b><field name="Form 2:Q1:a"/></b></font><font color="FF0000"><b> is not in the list.</b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><font><b>Try again!</b></font></paragraph><paragraph indent="0" align="left"><tabPositions><tabStop position="2880"/></tabPositions><tab/><tab/></paragraph>
</xmlData>
</document>
</documents>
</project>
